{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "94",
 "name": "Old Fields Road",
 "file": "Map94_Old_Fields_Road.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":380,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Fields","descriptions":["Rutted tracks wind between tumbledown stone walls overgrown with pigweed and nutgrass.  Periodic rumbles from the distant volcano continue to shake stones loose from crumbling mortar.  The fields beyond are full of grasses and weeds, choking out any remaining crops."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":2,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":2,"x":400,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Reshalia Trade Road, Farmland","descriptions":["The steep berm east of the road curves around from east to south.  The far curvature to the east is almost visible, but the smooth, grassy ridge disappears to the south too far for one to make out the southern boundary.  A narrow strip of wasteland runs between the base of the berm and the trade road, while across the road a wider strip of cropland spreads out all the way to the base of a large volcano just visible on the horizon."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":0,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":1,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}],"linksTo":"Map92_Reshalia_Trade_Road.xml"},
  {"id":3,"x":360,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Fields","descriptions":["Overgrown wagon tracks run between the road and a cluster of decaying buildings.  Granite rocks form heaps and piles alongside the tracks, vainly attempting to keep back the weeds.  The stones once formed fences, but now appear more like cairns in the tall grass."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":4,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":4,"x":340,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Vacant Farm","descriptions":["Bare ground is rapidly losing the battle against the weeds, with crabgrass runners and dandelions predominating.  Stumps of buildings rise waist-high here and there, their roof timbers collapsed inward or missing altogether."],"exits":[{"to":3,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":5,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":5,"x":320,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Vacant Farm","descriptions":["One lone building stands forlornly among the ruins of a farm.  Its walls and roof are heaped over with dirt and turf, turning the whole structure into a low hill.  A gaping doorway leads into the darkness of the interior, a small trickle of water seeping over the doorstep and oozing into the dirt."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":6,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":"go gaping doorway"}]},
  {"id":6,"x":300,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Vacant Farm","descriptions":["Weathered and battered, the walls of a barn lay collapsed beside the ruts of the road.  Another structure lies across the road, its form entirely shrouded in piles of wild kord.  Tendrils of kord cloak the skeleton of an oak tree that stood too close."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":7,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":7,"x":280,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Idle Fields","descriptions":["Corn stalks fight a losing battle with mallow and pigweed in the fields bordering the road.  Dandelions sprout in the center of the road, their yellow flowers doing little to relieve the desolate emptiness.  Low hills lie to the west and south, slowly rising in the distance to the base of the large volcano with wisps of smoke rising from its crater."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":8,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":8,"x":260,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Idle Fields","descriptions":["Boulder-strewn fields testify to the power of the distant volcano.  One large boulder landed on a stone wall, causing it to collapse.  The field within is bare of all but groundsel and thistle with not even one volunteer crop plant to tell what was once cultivated there."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":9,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":9,"x":240,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Low Hills","descriptions":["The roadway skims and dodges low rolling hills that climb out of the untended fields.  Several stumps stand stoically on the hillside while the grass and thistle sway in the wind."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":10,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":10,"x":220,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Low Hills","descriptions":["Scrub shrubs cling tenaciously to the sides of the hills, their very existence precarious in this desolate waste.  Cinder and rock covers much of the ground, mute testimony to the power of the looming volcano.  The remains of the road twist and turn between the hills as it travels through the scarred terrain."],"exits":[{"to":9,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":11,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":11,"x":200,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Low Hills","descriptions":["Steep hillsides rise to the south of the road as it follows the banks of a once-flourishing stream that is now a rock-choked trickle of water.  Rotted logs and broken stumps line the bends of the streambed."],"exits":[{"to":10,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":12,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":12,"x":180,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Low Hills","descriptions":["Cinder and ash completely obliterate parts of the track, leaving only patches of ruts between the barren hillsides.  Tiny shrubs cling tenaciously to the ground and are just about the only sign of life around."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":13,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":13,"x":160,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Low Hills","descriptions":["One side of a hill to the east has slumped down into the valley the roadway threads through.  The scar from the mudslide has softened somewhat, but no plant life yet grows on it.  Cinder and ash blow fitfully in the wind, and an occasional rumble from the volcano sends the stench of sulfur drifting on the breeze."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":14,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":14,"x":140,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Low Hills","descriptions":["The path twists here, snaking along the side of a hill from the top of a plateau down to a small valley below.  Scrawny grasses and a few battered weeds scatter in tufts on the ground.  A deep crack in the ground leads downward into shadow."],"exits":[{"to":13,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":15,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":21,"exit":"climb","move":"climb deep crack"}]},
  {"id":15,"x":120,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Low Hills","descriptions":["Tumbleweeds skitter back and forth in the wind, occasionally catching on a boulder or low-lying shrub.  The route is the barest hint of a path threading its way between the debris, revealing itself mainly as an absence of stones or rocks."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":16,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":16,"x":100,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Low Hills","descriptions":["Tufts of grass grow around an old post.  A comparative oasis in this barren area, the small patch of life only further underscores the bleakness of the landscape.  The sullen volcano rises to the west and dominates the countryside with rumbles and belches."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":17,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":17,"x":80,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Low Hills","descriptions":["The track traces its way over a small streamlet, crossing on the remains of a bridge.  A few ambitious juriweed plants tightly clench the ground near the stream, grimly clinging to life."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":18,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":18,"x":60,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Bluff Edge","descriptions":["Sheer cliffs fall away to the north, providing a panorama of the sea.  To the south, a large volcano rises out of a surrounding landscape of squat hills.  Vines creep up the cliffs from the base, seeking out all possible spots for growth."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":19,"exit":"west","move":"west"}]},
  {"id":19,"x":40,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Bluff Edge","descriptions":["Steep bluffs, deeply eroded by gullies and washes, terminate the trail.  The ocean is visible below as a rolling, deep azure-blue field.  Mallow and groundsel spread about the dusty ground and cling to the edge."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":"go thin trail"}]},
  {"id":20,"x":320,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, Springhouse","descriptions":["A constant drip, drip, drip echoes through the dank confines of the old springhouse.  A moss-covered stone slab lies halfway off of a small clear pool.  The overflow from the pool trickles across the floor and over the sagging doorstep.  Deep in one of corners, a lone cricket chirps and is answered from another corner.  An abandoned bucket hangs forlornly on the damp walls."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":"go gaping doorway"}]},
  {"id":21,"x":230,"y":260,"z":0,"title":"Old Fields Road, A Deep Crack","descriptions":["Thin light filters into the darkness of the deep wound in the island's foundation.  The narrow space is made more crowded by thick growths of sea vines flourishing in the warm, moist air rising from the shadows far, far below."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"climb","move":"climb deep crack"}]},
  {"id":22,"x":20,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs","descriptions":["The sandy soil shifts easily underfoot, sending small landslides down the uneven slope.  Straw-like tufts of grass grow from cracks in rocks and on any vaguely horizontal surface.  Above, a thin trail winds inland through the grass."],"exits":[{"to":23,"exit":"climb","move":"climb down path"},{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":"go thin trail"}]},
  {"id":23,"x":20,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs","descriptions":["Protruding stones provide more solid footholds than the loose and sandy soil.  Further down the slope, the soft loam gives way entirely to large slabs of broken rock.  The soothing sounds of surf washes up from below, pierced now and again by the cry of a sea bird."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"climb","move":"climb down path"},{"to":22,"exit":"climb","move":"climb up path"}]},
  {"id":24,"x":20,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs","descriptions":["Gulls reel and swoop through the sky, crying out soulfully to each other.  Occasionally, one dives and plunges into the sea and emerges triumphantly with a struggling fish in its beak."],"exits":[{"to":25,"exit":"climb","move":"climb down path"},{"to":23,"exit":"climb","move":"climb up path"}]},
  {"id":25,"x":20,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs","descriptions":["In the distance, great masted ships look like splinters of brown and white slipping over the horizon and out of sight while others emerge and gradually draw closer.  Long before the bluffs greeted the ships of mortals, it is rumored they were home to the island's fae."],"exits":[{"to":26,"exit":"climb","move":"climb down path"},{"to":24,"exit":"climb","move":"climb up path"}]},
  {"id":26,"x":20,"y":80,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs","descriptions":["The wind ebbs and flows like the waves below, but with a rhythm all its own.  Sometimes the soft breezes sound like a ballad quietly whispered between the land and sea, while at other times the wind sings shrilly across the crags like a bitter song of mourning."],"exits":[{"to":27,"exit":"climb","move":"climb down path"},{"to":25,"exit":"climb","move":"climb up path"}]},
  {"id":27,"x":20,"y":100,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs","descriptions":["The sheer bluffs soften to a sharply sloping talus of rock slabs either broken off of or dislodged from the cliff above.  Water seeps up between the large stones, creating calm tide pools where small schools of tiny silver fish dart about in search of food."],"exits":[{"to":28,"exit":"climb","move":"climb down path"},{"to":26,"exit":"climb","move":"climb up path"}]},
  {"id":28,"x":20,"y":120,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs","descriptions":["Mist-laden air sprays and swirls around the stony bluffs, slicking the already slippery rock.  Pearly little crustaceans about the size of walnuts cling to the safety of a slim crevice in the rock face."],"exits":[{"to":29,"exit":"climb","move":"climb down path"},{"to":27,"exit":"climb","move":"climb up path"}]},
  {"id":29,"x":20,"y":140,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs","descriptions":["Light and shadow play in the surf.  Moonlight catches waves as they grow from the sea and rides the crest above little pools of darkness that bob in and out of view.  As the waves crash against the stony shore, both are lost in a jubilant spray of white foam.","Light and shadow play against the surf.  Sunlight catches waves as they grow from the sea and rides the crest above little pools of darkness that bob in and out of view.  As the waves crash against the stony shore, both are lost in a jubilant spray of white foam."],"exits":[{"to":30,"exit":"climb","move":"climb down path"},{"to":28,"exit":"climb","move":"climb up path"}]},
  {"id":30,"x":20,"y":160,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs","descriptions":["An algae-stained precipice littered with broken rock and shells reaches out from the bluff in a broad arm that seems to hover just above the waterline."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"climb","move":"climb dark fissure"},{"to":29,"exit":"climb","move":"climb up path"}]},
  {"id":31,"x":20,"y":180,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs, Fissure","descriptions":["Briny water left by the receding tides fills the slim aperture in the stone.  Slimy strands of seaweed cling to the rock just above the waterline."],"exits":[{"to":32,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":30,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":32,"x":20,"y":200,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs, Fissure","descriptions":["The deep grey, mica-flecked stone walls have been worn smooth by ages of tides flowing through the narrow fissure."],"exits":[{"to":31,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":33,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"}]},
  {"id":33,"x":40,"y":220,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs, Fissure","descriptions":["The uneven walls grow close, making the passageway more difficult to navigate."],"exits":[{"to":34,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":32,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":34,"x":60,"y":240,"z":0,"title":"Egress Bluffs, Fissure","descriptions":["Thin light glows vaguely above and diffuses shadows lurking within the fissure."],"exits":[{"to":33,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":35,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":35,"x":120,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Softly fluorescing algae barely illuminates the capacious room leached from the island's foundation.  Twisted dripstone pillars seem to support a great canopy of stalactites hanging overhead like a frozen forest of weeping willows.  A thick stalagmite climbs out of the water and terminates near a ledge capping the limestone wall that skirts the cavern interior."],"exits":[{"to":47,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":36,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":34,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":79,"exit":"climb","move":"climb thick stalagmite"}]},
  {"id":36,"x":100,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["The cool water is shallow enough at the base of the wall to gaze at your footprints in the silt-dusted floor.  Soft light penetrating the limpid pool reveals an enormous cavern to the southeast looming beneath its diaphanous surface."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":46,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":47,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":37,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":37,"x":80,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Diffused light washes the misty air a ghostly blue.  Gentle currents of air nudge aside the saline mist to expose pools of light that dance over the water and make small ripples gleam like polished platinum.  Darkness peeks from a narrow crevice in the limestone wall."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":47,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":38,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":76,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow crevice"}]},
  {"id":38,"x":100,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["The sandy floor of the cavern falls away from the surrounding wall and the cool waters beckon you to follow.  Crystalline pool spar lining the bottom glistens through the water like a mythic treasure trove."],"exits":[{"to":36,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":39,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":37,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":55,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":39,"x":120,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Two massive columns of red-swirled dripstone rise from the water and meet overhead in a gently curving arch that soars above the ledge.  Heavy droplets of water carrying dissolved minerals and flecks of mica glitter gaily as they roll slowly down the graceful curves."],"exits":[{"to":40,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":56,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":81,"exit":"climb","move":"climb flowstone formation"}]},
  {"id":40,"x":140,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Gypsum crystals coating the rear of the cave sparkle like the first frost of winter and refract the light into millions of tiny rainbows that shower the wall with color."],"exits":[{"to":48,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":49,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":42,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":41,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":39,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":54,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":41,"x":160,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["The smell of brine makes the air feel heavy and dank in this dim corner of the cavern.  The granite wall to the east is oddly free of crystal or dripstone growth, but a series of shallow impressions in the stone weave a route up to the ledge above."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":42,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":40,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":57,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":42,"x":180,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Like sharpened teeth dripping with spittle, stalactites pierce the shadows above and drip milky water into the water near the wall.  In places, stalagmites rise from the pool to meet them, making the cavern seem like the inside of some great creature's maw."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":41,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":40,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":58,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":43,"x":200,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Long tendrils of sea vines hang from the ledge high above the water.  The milky drip of mineral-laden water frosts their deep green leaves, making them glitter in the shifting light."],"exits":[{"to":42,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":44,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":44,"x":180,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Shells speckling the cavern floor at the base of the wall paint the water with pinks and blues that swirl with colored minerals to form an amazing variety of hues.  Drafts of cool air descend from above and move through the area, pushing whorls of mist over the water's surface."],"exits":[{"to":43,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":46,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":45,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"}]},
  {"id":45,"x":160,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["The sound of water sloshing against the stone walls echoes through the cavern, occasionally punctuated by loud plops of moisture dripping into the pool.  Other, muffled sounds linger just beyond the reach of recognition before drowning in the steady rhythm of the water."],"exits":[{"to":44,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":49,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":46,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"}]},
  {"id":46,"x":140,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Shapes move in the darkness below, making themselves felt among the shadows by causing shifts in the water's steady current."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":44,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":48,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":47,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":36,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":51,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":47,"x":120,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["The surreal seascape of rainbow-hued dripstone formations is enrobed in soft light and the melodic burbling of running water.  Near the center of the cavern, the waters swirl with small whirlpools that dance across the glassy surface like frolicking sprites."],"exits":[{"to":35,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":48,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":40,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":37,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":36,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":50,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":48,"x":140,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Deep shadows hugging the periphery consume the walls and shroud the edges of the dark water, making the cavern feel infinitely larger.  Even the stout of heart would be moved to a startling feeling of insignificance in the center of the great mountain hollow."],"exits":[{"to":49,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":47,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":52,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":49,"x":160,"y":340,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Satha Cavern","descriptions":["Deep shadows hugging the periphery consume the walls and shroud the edges of the dark water, making the cavern feel infinitely larger.  Even the stout of heart would be moved to a startling feeling of insignificance in the center of the great mountain hollow."],"exits":[{"to":45,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":41,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":48,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":46,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":53,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":50,"x":100,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["Iridescent shells and yellowed splinters of bone collect in a small crevice in the stone, safe from the whirling current."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":52,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":47,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":51,"x":120,"y":420,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["A thin layer of sand shifts across an ebon-veined basalt shelf below that refused to be dissolved by the relentless water.  Strong currents pull across the sliver of stone, carrying loose debris off into the inky deep."],"exits":[{"to":53,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":52,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":46,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":52,"x":120,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["Shadows tint the waters in deepening shades of blue and violet, like veils of twilight lowered over evening."],"exits":[{"to":51,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":53,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":54,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":50,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":48,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":61,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":53,"x":140,"y":440,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["Only forty hands from the surface, the water cools considerably and descends another shade into darkness."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":52,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":49,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":54,"x":120,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["Muffled echoes bounce along the stone walls from every direction, ebbing and flowing with the gently whirling currents near the center of the cavern."],"exits":[{"to":52,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":57,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":56,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":50,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":40,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":60,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":55,"x":80,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["Thin light permeates the threadbare cloak of darkness near the water's surface and alights on crystalline pool spar growing on the cave bottom."],"exits":[{"to":56,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":56,"x":100,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["Dusky water swirls against the stone, patiently wearing it away over the eons.  A thin vein of softer stone in the wall has all but dissolved, leaving a deep crevice that looks like a black scar in ebon skin."],"exits":[{"to":54,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":59,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":55,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":39,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":62,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":57,"x":140,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["Shellfish line the inside of a thin crease in the stone like pearly white peas in a deep grey pod.  They glow softly in the thin film of light in the water and seem to flicker when shadows pass overhead."],"exits":[{"to":58,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":59,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":54,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":41,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":64,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":58,"x":160,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["Broken curls of flowstone, shards of stalactites and shattered gypsum crystals litter the floor of the small stone shelf.  The piles occasionally shift with the currents, sending some pieces sliding off of the shelf into the black deep."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":42,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":59,"x":120,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Underwater","descriptions":["A granite precipice looms overhead, but the umbrageous ceiling is paled by darker shadows stirring below.  Without a clear path to the surface, the grip of the water's depth seems stronger and closer."],"exits":[{"to":57,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":56,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":65,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":60,"x":200,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["The somber darkness swallows all light and color.  Everything, even one's own form, becomes one with the swirling black."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":65,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":62,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":54,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":71,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":61,"x":200,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["What light permeates the deepening shadow catches on flecks of mica and metallic debris caught up in the current to the south.  Through the clear water, it looks like a dust storm whirling through the nighttime desert."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":52,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":70,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":62,"x":180,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["Something reflective glints weakly through the darkness of the water below."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":63,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":56,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":74,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":63,"x":200,"y":560,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["The swirling currents of cold water bear down on interlopers in their realm, seeking to impose their will."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":64,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":73,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":64,"x":220,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["Visible through the thick darkness are the outlines of pale bones strewn across the floor below."],"exits":[{"to":65,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":60,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":57,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":72,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":65,"x":200,"y":540,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["The quiet blackness seems to voice itself in the patient shushing of the currents."],"exits":[{"to":60,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":64,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":63,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":62,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":59,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":75,"exit":"down","move":"down"}]},
  {"id":70,"x":280,"y":460,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["Silt deposited on the stone floor by the dancing currents lays in concentric ripples pointing in the direction of the water's flow.  The striated sand looks much like the gills of a giant sea creature."],"exits":[{"to":61,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":71,"x":280,"y":480,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["Shadows move with you in the darkness, accompanied by muffled barks and wails that bounce and warble through the depths."],"exits":[{"to":72,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":60,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":72,"x":300,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["Lying broken and slightly askew like a large cracked egg, a pale white Gor'Tog skull gleams through the darkness.  The former braincase has become home to a group of eyeless black fish that weave placidly in and out of the jagged-edged hollow."],"exits":[{"to":73,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":64,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":73,"x":280,"y":520,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["Chilling currents pull and push, stealing body heat and making navigating the litter-strewn cavern floor more difficult."],"exits":[{"to":74,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":63,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":74,"x":260,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["A pile of rusting swords and armor sends a small tempest of ruddy flakes up into the whirling current.  Diminutive black fish dart voraciously through the maze of iron and steel, looking for smaller or slower kin to feed on."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":62,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":75,"x":280,"y":500,"z":0,"title":"Satha Cavern, Itan Deep","descriptions":["The tenebrous deep reveals little but the vague outlines of rusting armor and bits of their former owners scattered across the cavern floor."],"exits":[{"to":71,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":72,"exit":"east","move":"east"},{"to":73,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":74,"exit":"west","move":"west"},{"to":65,"exit":"up","move":"up"}]},
  {"id":76,"x":80,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Narrow Crevice","descriptions":["The slimy stone walls are close and the air is thick with the scent of briny seawater that fills the bottom of the crevice."],"exits":[{"to":77,"exit":"up","move":"up"},{"to":37,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":77,"x":40,"y":280,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Narrow Crevice","descriptions":["The slimy stone walls are close and the air is thick with the heavy scent of the briny seawater below."],"exits":[{"to":76,"exit":"down","move":"down"},{"to":78,"exit":"out","move":"out"}]},
  {"id":78,"x":40,"y":320,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Ledge","descriptions":["A rippling curtain of blue and green flowstone seems to dance along the edge of a granite mantle about ten hands overhead.  Shifting light reflected from the pool's surface casts pinks and yellows on the curtain, mixing new colors that fade and blend into others."],"exits":[{"to":79,"exit":"northeast","move":"northeast"},{"to":80,"exit":"south","move":"south"},{"to":77,"exit":"go","move":"go narrow crevice"},{"to":36,"exit":"none","move":"dive water"}]},
  {"id":79,"x":60,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Ledge","descriptions":["Patiently formed through eons of dripping water depositing layers of colorful minerals, flowstone blankets the walls with rainbow-hued folds and drapes."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"southwest","move":"southwest"},{"to":35,"exit":"none","move":"dive water"},{"to":35,"exit":"climb","move":"climb thick stalagmite"}]},
  {"id":80,"x":40,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Ledge","descriptions":["The sulfur-laden limestone walls of the large grotto glow a pale green in the ghostly blue light of the cavern.  The light pools in the wet sand and gravel deposited in ripples along the stone floor."],"exits":[{"to":78,"exit":"north","move":"north"},{"to":81,"exit":"southeast","move":"southeast"},{"to":38,"exit":"none","move":"dive water"}]},
  {"id":81,"x":60,"y":380,"z":0,"title":"Tembat Nai Itan, Ledge","descriptions":["In static waves, a red-swirled flowstone formation rolls down the ledge and into the water more than eighty hands below."],"exits":[{"to":80,"exit":"northwest","move":"northwest"},{"to":39,"exit":"none","move":"dive water"},{"to":39,"exit":"climb","move":"climb flowstone formation"}]}
 ],
 "labels": [
  {"text":"Merrows","x":190,"y":390,"z":0},
  {"text":"Selkie","x":190,"y":400,"z":0}
 ]
}
